{"id":"d288337a9c4d6588","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-mod-finite-nonembedding.md","title":"P(ω)/fin 无法嵌入 c.e. 度结构","display":"thm-mod-finite-nonembedding — P(ω)/fin 无法嵌入 c.e. 度结构","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-mod-finite-nonembedding","aliases":["20-thm-mod-finite-nonembedding"],"display":"thm-mod-finite-nonembedding — P(ω)/fin 无法嵌入 c.e. 度结构","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.degree-structure","source_kind":"local-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"本地基数论证；原名称修正","depends_on":["[[20-df-mod-finite]]","[[20-df-redeg]]","[[20-df-degle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-mod-finite-nonembedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-mod-finite-nonembedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mod-finite-nonembedding — P(ω)/fin 无法嵌入 c.e. 度结构"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.degree-structure"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"本地基数论证；原名称修正"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68ee45ca9dee2182\" href=\"?note=68ee45ca9dee2182\" title=\"20-df-mod-finite\">20-df-mod-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,\\widetilde A,\\widetilde B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B,\\widetilde A,\\widetilde B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^*\">\\([A]^*\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq^*\">\\(\\subseteq^*\\)</span> 为上游模有限等价类与包含关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in Q\">\\(a,b\\in Q\\)</span> 是等价类而非自然数集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 为 c.e. 度族，右侧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 为其度顺序。Q 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le^*\">\\(\\le^*\\)</span> 在下文独立按原模有限包含定义，不借用只声明于 c.e. 商载体的未说明扩张。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"68ee45ca9dee2182\" href=\"?note=68ee45ca9dee2182\" title=\"20-df-mod-finite\">20-df-mod-finite</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nQ:=\\{[A]^*:A\\subseteq\\omega\\},\\\\\na\\le^*b\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists A\\in a\\ \\exists B\\in b\\ [A\\subseteq^*B]\\quad(a,b\\in Q),\\\\\n(A=^*\\widetilde A\\land B=^*\\widetilde B)\\Rightarrow\n(A\\subseteq^*B\\Longleftrightarrow \\widetilde A\\subseteq^*\\widetilde B),\\\\\n[A]^*\\le^*[B]^*\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq^*B.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nQ:=\\{[A]^*:A\\subseteq\\omega\\},\\\\\na\\le^*b\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists A\\in a\\ \\exists B\\in b\\ [A\\subseteq^*B]\\quad(a,b\\in Q),\\\\\n(A=^*\\widetilde A\\land B=^*\\widetilde B)\\Rightarrow\n(A\\subseteq^*B\\Longleftrightarrow \\widetilde A\\subseteq^*\\widetilde B),\\\\\n[A]^*\\le^*[B]^*\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq^*B.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mod\\text{-}finite\\text{-}nonembedding}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists f:Q\\to\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\forall a,b\\in Q\\ [a\\le^*b\\Longleftrightarrow f(a)\\le f(b)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mod\\text{-}finite\\text{-}nonembedding}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists f:Q\\to\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\forall a,b\\in Q\\ [a\\le^*b\\Longleftrightarrow f(a)\\le f(b)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Q 是所有自然数子集的模有限商，不是仅由 c.e. 集合构成的商。有限改变不影响模有限包含，所以所定义商序与代表元无关；在 c.e. 子商上它与原记号一致。不存在保序且反映顺序映射的结论保持不变；文件名改为 mod-finite-nonembedding，准确指向此处的商序。</p>\n<p>来源：本地基数论证；原名称修正。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mod-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mod-finite]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-degle]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mod-finite]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-degle]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mod-finite]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-degle]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,\\widetilde A,\\widetilde B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\subseteq^*","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le","display":false},{"tex":"\\le^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nQ:=\\{[A]^*:A\\subseteq\\omega\\},\\\\\na\\le^*b\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists A\\in a\\ \\exists B\\in b\\ [A\\subseteq^*B]\\quad(a,b\\in Q),\\\\\n(A=^*\\widetilde A\\land B=^*\\widetilde B)\\Rightarrow\n(A\\subseteq^*B\\Longleftrightarrow \\widetilde A\\subseteq^*\\widetilde B),\\\\\n[A]^*\\le^*[B]^*\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq^*B.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mod\\text{-}finite\\text{-}nonembedding}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists f:Q\\to\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\forall a,b\\in Q\\ [a\\le^*b\\Longleftrightarrow f(a)\\le f(b)].","display":true}],"bytes":2023,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["68ee45ca9dee2182","f389bdba28de0478","e888141c21b61ce5"]}